- Documents of the user, in the head bar: which one is open, its name, a new one.
- Owns no data. The store is handed in by the app so that the whole editor holds
- one, and every value shown here is read from it and written back into it.
$bog_vmap_app_scenes $mol_view
	store $bog_vmap_app_store
	- Link of the open document, empty when there is none yet. Two way: picking
	- one writes the address, and the address is what the store reads.
	current? \
	title? \
	- Whether there is a document to name at all. The field is off without one,
	- so that a name typed into an empty editor does not grab a land per keystroke.
	current_exists false
	sub /
		<= Pick $mol_select
			hint \Сцена
			dictionary <= scene_dict *
			option_label_default \Без названия
			value? <=> current?
		<= Title $mol_string
			hint \Название сцены
			enabled <= current_exists
			value? <=> title?
		<= Add $mol_button_minor
			title \Новая сцена
			hint \Завести новый документ. Он станет текущим
			click? <=> add? null
